```java
final class Quadratics {
    static BigDecimal eval(BigDecimal a, BigDecimal b, BigDecimal c, BigDecimal x) {
        return a.multiply(x).multiply(x).add(b.multiply(x)).add(c);
    }
    /** 导数 2ax+b 在 x 处的精确值 */
    static BigDecimal derivative(BigDecimal a, BigDecimal b, BigDecimal x) {
        return a.add(a).multiply(x).add(b);
    }
}
```

Bisection in MeasurementService or a dedicated InverseSolver:

```java
final class InverseSolver {
    private static final BigDecimal TWO = new BigDecimal("2");
    private static final BigDecimal MAX_WIDTH = new BigDecimal("0.000001");

    /** 在单调分支 [lo,hi] 上夹逼 f(x)=signal 的唯一根，返回宽度 ≤ 1e-6 的夹逼区间。 */
    static BigDecimal[] bracket(BigDecimal a, BigDecimal b, BigDecimal c,
                                BigDecimal lo, BigDecimal hi, BigDecimal signal) {
        boolean increasing = Quadratics.eval(...lo).compareTo(eval(hi)) < 0; // or derivative sign
        BigDecimal lower = lo, upper = hi;
        while (upper.subtract(lower).compareTo(MAX_WIDTH) > 0) {
            BigDecimal mid = lower.add(upper).divide(TWO); // exact, scale+1
            BigDecimal fMid = eval(a,b,c,mid);
            int cmp = fMid.compareTo(signal);
            if (cmp == 0) { return new BigDecimal[]{mid, mid}; }
            boolean rootAbove = increasing ? cmp < 0 : cmp > 0;
            if (rootAbove) lower = mid; else upper = mid;
        }
        return new BigDecimal[]{lower, upper};
    }
}
```

Wait `divide(TWO)` — BigDecimal divide by 2: exact when scale allows; e.g. 1/2 = 0.5 exact — divide(BigDecimal) throws ArithmeticException only on non-terminating. Halving a decimal always terminates. ✓

