Main compiles. Now write tests. Three new test files:

1. `QuadraticCertificateApiTest` — creation main flow + failure branches + idempotency basics.
2. `InverseMeasurementApiTest` — synthetic example, failure branches, release gates, mixed batch.
3. `IdempotencyConcurrencyTest` — concurrent same-requestId submits, replay consistency.

Also existing tests clean tables; my new tests must clean idempotency_record too.

Let me write the tests. Note file size limit ~200 lines per write — split into multiple writes if needed.

Test 1: QuadraticCertificateApiTest

```java
package com.example.starter.calibration;

// imports...

@SpringBootTest
@AutoConfigureMockMvc
class QuadraticCertificateApiTest {
    @Autowired MockMvc mvc;
    @Autowired JdbcTemplate jdbc;

    @BeforeEach clean: DELETE FROM idempotency_record, release_record, measurement, calibration_certificate, instrument_lock

    private String quadJson(String requestId, String operator, String instrument, String from, String to,
                            String a, String b, String c, String lo, String hi) { ... }

    @Test createQuadraticCertificateReturns201WithBranch()
      - POST /api/certificates/quadratic y=x² on [1,3] → 201, certType QUADRATIC, a "1", c "0", domainLo "1", domainHi "3", revoked false
    @Test zeroCoefficientARejected400
    @Test nonMonotoneRejected400: 
        - y=x² on [-1,3] (sign change) → 400 NON_MONOTONE_CERTIFICATE
        - y=x² on [0,3] (derivative zero at endpoint) → 400
        - y=-x² on [1,3] decreasing → 201
    @Test invalidDomainAndDecimalsRejected400: lo>=hi → 400; a with 7 decimals → 400
    @Test missingRequestIdOrOperatorRejected400
    @Test overlapWithLinearCertificateConflict409
    @Test replayReturnsFirstResponseAndParamChange409:
        - create with requestId Q-1 → 201 body1
        - repeat same body → 201, identical body (same cert id), only 1 cert row
        - same requestId different param (b "1") → 409 IDEMPOTENCY_PARAMS_MISMATCH
        - decimal same-value: a "1.0" vs "1.00" → replay (same response)
        - failure doesn't occupy: requestId Q-2 with non-monotone → 400; then Q-2 with valid params → 201
    }
```

